#====================================================================
# E224 - Conan CMake test argument routing
#====================================================================

id:                     E301
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|ctest
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        cmake --build.*--target test.*--output-on-failure|Unknown argument --output-on-failure

severity:               2
category:               conan-cmake-test-argument-routing
match_keywords:         CMake.test, CMake.ctest, cli_args, --output-on-failure, cmake --build, ctest
title:                  Conan CMake.test cli_args are build arguments, not CTest arguments

root_cause:             In Conan 2, CMake.test() runs cmake --build with the test target, so its cli_args are routed to cmake --build; only CMake.ctest() routes cli_args to ctest.
affected_scope:         Conan 2 CMake recipes that run upstream CTest suites and pass CTest flags through CMake.test(cli_args=...).
verification_cmd:       Inspect conan.tools.cmake.CMake.test and CMake.ctest, then run conan create on a host where can_run() is true.

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           use-cmake-ctest-helper
rec_description:        Use cmake.ctest(cli_args=[...]) for CTest options after cmake.build(); reserve cmake.test() for invoking the build system test target with build arguments.
rec_command:            Replace cmake.test(cli_args=["--output-on-failure"]) with cmake.ctest(cli_args=["--output-on-failure"]).
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               manual-conan-recipe-edit

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      explicit-ctest-run
fallback_description:   Run ctest explicitly from the CMake build folder with the Conan build and run environments activated.
fallback_command:       ctest --output-on-failure
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          manual

forbid_1_pattern:       cmake\.test\(cli_args=.*--output-on-failure
forbid_1_reason:        --output-on-failure is a CTest option, but CMake.test() forwards cli_args to cmake --build.
forbid_1_consequence:   Native or target-device builds fail before running any tests, while cross builds may hide the defect behind can_run() == false.

principles:             
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               doc/E301.md
last_updated:           2026-07-19
source_event:           iir1/1.10.0 HarmonyOS PC native Conan validation

authors:                2301_80739235 <2047361658@qq.com>
